ollbar-drag\" class=\"fs-slider-gallery_scrollbar_drag\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"faq-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bc3\" style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"header-faq\"><h2>Louvered Roof System FAQs</h2><div>Have questions about motorized louvered roof system installation in Florida? Our licensed outdoor living specialists answer your top questions here.</div></div><div class=\"wrapper-faq-components\"><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bc7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">How do motorized louvered roofs work in Florida weather?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Motorized louvers tilt open to allow full airflow and natural light or close completely to create a waterproof overhead shelter, controlled by remote or smartphone app. This flexibility lets Florida homeowners enjoy their outdoor spaces through intense heat, afternoon storms, and cool winter evenings alike.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bcf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Are louvered roof systems hurricane-rated in Florida?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. Louvered roof systems use reinforced extruded aluminum and marine-grade stainless steel hardware, engineered to withstand Florida's high winds. Our systems carry wind-load engineering documentation and are installed to meet local building codes — including HVHZ requirements where applicable in South Florida.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bd7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Can lighting and fans be added to a louvered roof?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. Motorized louvered roof systems can integrate recessed LED lighting, ceiling fans, and radiant heating elements directly into the structure. Electrical work is coordinated during installation, and all additions are permitted through local Florida building departments and HOA architectural review boards where required.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bdf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">What color options are available for louvered roofs?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Louvered roof systems are available in a wide range of powder-coated aluminum finishes, including neutral tones and custom colors to complement your home's exterior trim or fence lines. Our team provides color samples and design consultation to ensure seamless integration with your Florida home's architecture and HOA requirements.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077be7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">How do I properly maintain outdoor installations?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Simply rinse the louvers periodically to remove dust and debris. The powder-coated aluminum finish resists rust, peeling, and UV fading in Florida's coastal and inland climates. Unlike wood or canvas structures, motorized louvered roof systems require no seasonal resealing, repainting, or fabric replacement — a genuinely low-maintenance investment.</p></nav></div></div></div><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/images/site/design2-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/design2-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/design2-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/design2-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/site/design2.webp 1920w\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/site/design2.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"design-bg\"></section></div><section class=\"location\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"dfdd7317-58e7-27b3-99a6-2c20a5e8a7be\" class=\"header-location\"><h2>Where We Serve</h2><p>Regional Coverage With National Vision</p></div></div><div class=\"cms-country w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"cms-list-country w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-country w-dyn-item\"><img src=\"/images/where-we-serves/custom-pool-builders-south-florida/custom-inground-pool-builders-remodeling-florida.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Aerial drone view of a luxury custom pool and outdoor living project